{
  // ============================================================================
  // Desert Fish — Recommended VS Code Extensions
  // ============================================================================
  // When you open this folder in VS Code it will prompt:
  //   "This workspace has extension recommendations. Install all?"
  //   → Click "Install All" on both Macs.
  //
  // IMPORTANT: The Remote SSH extensions (top section) install on your LOCAL Mac.
